  - name: Liz's Demo
    description: Lizband's concept for what the first chapter of the game would play
      like.
    levelSets:
    - name: Intro Sequence
      description: 
      levels: []
    - name: 'Chapter 1 - Section 1: Test Track'
      description: The team makes their way through separate testing tracks to obtain
        their own spacial distorion devices to aid in their decent. They just have
        to regroup at the end of their tracks to get to the level 2 station.
      levels:
