    - name: 'Chapter 1 - Section 2: Behind the scenes'
      description: Escape! Escape! The Director has discovered the team's betrayl
        and has sent security to take them out. With all safety protocols disabled,
        Kellory, Jamiey, and Osiris must now exit the main testing track and B-Line
        for the level 2 station earlier than intended while avoiding the Okami facilities
        various security patrols.
      levels:
